 ],
 "synopsis": "Condiment and sauce maker Veeba Foods has kicked off a pre-IPO fundraise, targeting a valuation of over Rs 8,000 crore. The transaction involves a proposed secondary minority sale of under 10 percent. The company is backed by Verlinvest, DSG Consumer Partners, and Saama Capital, alongside founder Viraj Bahl who holds a stake in the mid-40s percentage. Axis Capital, Jefferies, Motilal Oswal, and 360 One Capital are advising on the round.",
